{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1000_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b82c98fb2d9c1fe9e9ee468ed0067087abec882e2a69cb3e9759957fcc4d833", "ja": "……そうだ！　奈緒、ミャオ。参考までに、\nふたりがなんて書いたのか、聞かせてくれよ。", "zh": "……有了！奈绪、美也。供我参考一下，\n跟我说说你们俩写了什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "f624bff3d5de0367573cd25024486802226fad64ab106bb8eecdb13f3d52a3ff", "ja": "私はもちろん、『関西の星』やな♪\nアイドルとして、故郷にでっかい錦を飾ったるわ！", "zh": "当然是“关西之星”啦♪ 作为偶像，我要衣锦还乡，给故乡挣个大面子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "0d73d56468e81b7a2898ccc32ee27c53f1339533a555b20fd50a584be64cf88a", "ja": "なるほど……ミャオは？", "zh": "原来如此……咪喵呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "92d2497278674191cdd2b6b0136948fbfbbd5d5c586a5694d3d0fc8a6b89c243", "ja": "私の夢は、歴史の教科書に載ることですよ～。\nそのために、アイドルになったんです～。", "zh": "我的梦想是登上历史教科书哦～。所以，我才成为偶像的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "e3d58fadec018e2010334dd6d5e504e8e30702d23b195cd2499fc1fcdecd189c", "ja": "へ？　れ、歴史の教科書……？", "zh": "诶？历、历史教科书……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "cb82ca2f5749a527116e2e9c06dbb8da7905df98ad2774de595e52f9924cfd10", "ja": "はい～。ものすごい発明をする人や、世界で活躍する\nスポーツ選手には、なれないかもしれませんが～……。", "zh": "是的～。也许我没法成为发明出惊人发明的人，或是在世界上大放异彩的运动员～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "ea511d55c5863aa2868e621a9593c81ff06f9f7836950717f53e07532a55763e", "ja": "みんなを笑顔にすることなら、\n私にもできるかもしれない、と思ったので～。", "zh": "但要是让大家露出笑容的话，\n我觉得或许我也能做得到～的一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "32f80bec71a1e5216697d792f66489ee5f35446f8d6a7911778d9c03e7ee5010", "ja": "なるほど、それでアイドル……。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才当上偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "0a677f40453fce7fbdec30bee311314c7464e0e684e74b33423fd5d9fb64b213", "ja": "おお……なんや、めっちゃ壮大な夢やん！\n見直したで、美也！", "zh": "哦……原来如此，是个相当宏大的梦想啊！\n我对你刮目相看了，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fd5b2145f0d7e5d2a44075f5589d6899a9fc5340a11796d306e42ef2b7d769a", "ja": "お～、本当ですか～？　奈緒ちゃんに\n応援してもらえるのは、うれしいですな～。", "zh": "哦～，真的吗～？能得到奈绪的支持，我很开心呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "dee202c3c73d7240f6bc2b3d46cecdf74716aae28ccfb33c9c8af0acceff4d17", "ja": "……。\nみんな、色々考えてるんだな……。", "zh": "……。\n大家，都有在认真考虑各种事情啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "ec3bfc9498af4290eacd96424b98fa8ed47319ab12afab0880cee1edcff5f1de", "ja": "……？　ジュリアちゃん……？", "zh": "……？　茱莉亚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1012_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "4e4d5506cd534245d309693fcadda317f61d9a26ce219b7586f9dda8ad38d9c3", "ja": "お疲れさまです……えっ？\nジュリアさん？", "zh": "辛苦了……咦？\n茱莉亚先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "fa0764d2b50bfa0782a2c9a2aad713ce80eee2123a6ef5141f7786d9380b37a5", "ja": "あら、本当！　ツアー中だからかしら、\nなんだか久しぶりな気がするわね♪", "zh": "哎呀，真的耶！可能是因为正在巡演吧，\n总觉得好久没见了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "f1f13f7ae52ca31e04f0e97ab229b825da82ab66af38ffa9f5b9e16e9de5eb85", "ja": "シホ、このみ姉、お疲れ。\n所属してるチームが違うと、すれ違いになるよな。", "zh": "志保、好久不见。这次辛苦了。\n所属的队伍不同，就容易错过彼此呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ed3883604ab1660f6d2f8aa484e88bb153e9e2224e8c39f9a6601ac19717aae", "ja": "みんなは、今からミーティングか？", "zh": "大家现在要去开会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "d786554f97b6bafc3682c5eadc0d0d1ebcf5a1046a00c1200bab1292e2a49946", "ja": "ええ、そうなの。定期公演のミーティングだから、\n{$P$}もそろそろ……あ、来たわ。", "zh": "是的，就是这样。是定期公演的会议，所以{$P$}也差不多该……啊，来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1018_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f20b37ad9fd019f048030206801c3be6584930363a46a68f4b4fb68be2896585", "ja": "みんな、おまたせ……あれ？\nジュリア、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "大家，久等了……咦？\n茱莉亚，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2b4d3cc389b91ab87c802155d432a411516bca3887d93d6c15aa2c50ea60344", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}。この前渡された\nアンケート用紙、控え室に忘れてっちゃってさ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。之前拿给我的问卷，我忘在休息室了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1021_p", "source_sha256": "28546ec86ac412accaf030637ce3d11fd79b23d0f1ec5d6438e9f72fb64684f8", "ja": "わざわざ取りに来たのか？\n言ってくれれば、家まで届けたのに。", "zh": "你还特意跑过来拿吗？\n跟我说一声的话，我就给你送到家里去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "0bd1829a94f2ac8f64eb8d7da123109a02e283e35bb0af84e91bd1fb072b4d6c", "ja": "いや、外出るついでだったから。\nそれじゃ、あたしは帰るよ。", "zh": "没事，我也只是顺便出门。\n那我先回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1023_p", "source_sha256": "51ff684207427f04270ab7c0d4e779a4518d11f6a98874d8e48bf6f207b22a6e", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1024_se", "source_sha256": "eb4c048e033caf434564d9e67c9f30521449d9b8cd2310ccaf6b5f46b5e6cf96", "ja": "ガチャ、……バタン", "zh": "咔嗒，……砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "37ec044aa5cfed5750ac5052acb5daf6c9bf309320a15de334e3a290827c58a2", "ja": "ジュリアさん、なんだか元気がないように\n見えましたけど……何かあったんですか？", "zh": "茱莉亚先生，感觉您似乎有些没精神……是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "4cc4e6ecd39da5c635e579caffc50bb399a788f66a4a17c831e22f5f1c0a411b", "ja": "うーん。ジュリア、真面目なとこあるしな。\nアンケート、けっこう悩んでんのかもしれへん……。", "zh": "嗯……茱莉亚也有认真过头的一面嘛。问卷调查，她说不定正挺纠结的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1027_p", "source_sha256": "84657a4d7a874f75ad2ce12dce984589a83a5c8131315ebff0dbfbc5f0fdc526", "ja": "アンケートって、『アイグラ！！』のか？\n内容は……確か、「あなたの夢」だったか。", "zh": "你说的问卷，是《偶像写真！！》的那个吗？\n内容……我记得是“你的梦想”来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "cc04d5ce23b04dc05b5215330c642e6679f92a01511e46b8f399330e139cf985", "ja": "『ロックなアイドル』は前にも書いたし、ある意味\n叶っているので、どうしようって言ってましたよ～。", "zh": "“摇滚偶像”之前也写过了，而且从某种意义上来说已经实现了，所以我还说过该怎么办呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1029_p", "source_sha256": "71786ae9992ed33fea9db8f2823848c37b7424f134d1946ca1c03cef3cd9ecf4", "ja": "なるほど。ある意味叶ってる、か。\nだとしたら……。", "zh": "原来如此。某种意义上已经实现了啊。\n既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ebe7cd4dbca266a37cc29f9bb83b94d30102f78bf5def32191ef459714bc46fc", "ja": "ジュリアの夢が変わる……というか、\n次の段階へ移っていく時期なのかもしれないな。", "zh": "茱莉亚的梦想会改变……或者说，或许是时候迈向下一个阶段了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "bf5f484f2c8587915567af47bf759748a213ccaf8b5a680261801fab1d854f6d", "ja": "夢が変わって、次の段階に移っていく……か……。\n……。", "zh": "梦想改变，迈向下一个阶段……吗……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_107_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_107_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a7afa60241077bfc8f07c69b49ff825571f9afc460464e91d802670bf7dbc0a", "ja": "さてと……\n帰る前に、楽器屋に寄ってかないとな。", "zh": "那么……\n回去之前，得顺路去趟乐器店才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
